    "group": "Catacomb Command Barge",
    "summary": "Once per battle, as any phase ends, this unit can pick up to 1 friendly unit within 6\" of it that is **NECRONS INFANTRY** or **NECRONS MOUNTED**. The picked unit **resurrects**: its [Reanimation Protocols](vsdata:ability/necrons.reanimation-protocols) activate, but it **heals** D6 wounds rather than D3.\n\nYou can't make more than 1 unit **resurrect** per turn.",
